# Documentation Emoji Policy

- Do not use emojis in any project documentation files (for example, files under `docs/`, `INDEX.md`, or additional Markdown guides).
- When editing or adding documentation, remove existing emojis and use plain text headings and emphasis instead.
- This rule does not affect application UI copy; it only applies to repository documentation content.

